&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;88db3405-f8ec-4c19-86a3-4b2ec897e7fc&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1974&quot; data-local-id=&quot;15729ee9&quot;&gt;You’ll design, implement, and maintain K8s-based solutions, clusters, and supporting AWS infrastructure that help other engineering teams run their applications reliably on Kubernetes. You’ll elevate how we deliver our business-critical applications on Kubernetes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2241&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f934b7d195ca&quot;&gt;You’ll work closely with the security team to maintain and increase emnify&#39;s security posture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2339&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4552cb08-46b6-49ff-8d3a-c1bccf75c828&quot;&gt;&lt;mark id=&quot;c0f5af5c-856c-488c-9a86-166ed47dccbf&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;c0f5af5c-856c-488c-9a86-166ed47dccbf&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;You’ll continuously improve our CI/CD systems and concepts&lt;/mark&gt;, enabling product teams to safely and efficiently deploy their applications on AWS-managed services and Kubernetes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2517&quot; data-local-id=&quot;983215ec-cf77-47b6-884f-914300bf78c9&quot;&gt;You’ll collaborate with the product teams and take an active part in implementing new infrastructure and services, providing valuable insights and implementation recommendations to ensure the successful and timely delivery of projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2756&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4c1d2618afd9&quot;&gt;As part of the internal team rotation, take part in supporting the teams in their day-to-day operations and challenges they are facing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&quot;Your-Skills:&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ae1f5458-baf8-4666-9d42-2055e4190444&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2895&quot;&gt;&lt;mark id=&quot;d628dbd7-953b-4ce7-9a3f-786e45a529ff&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;d628dbd7-953b-4ce7-9a3f-786e45a529ff&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;Your Skills: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/mark&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
