&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Working Student in part-time, up to 20 hours per week during the semester and up to 40 hours per week during semester breaks&lt;/li&gt;
