&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT QUINCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a destination for builders, creators, innovators, and operators who want to come together and challenge the status quo. Our mission is simple: make really high quality essentials for really low prices, fairly and sustainably. We deliver on that mission through a unique manufacturer-to-consumer (M2C) model eliminating the layers of traditional retail that add cost and result in consumers paying more than they need to. We find, build relationships with, and work directly with the manufacturing partners behind some of the world’s finest products. From there, our teams design smart, efficient operational processes&amp;nbsp; and build and deploy proprietary technology, AI, and analytics to help us scale fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What began with a small assortment of elevated basics has quickly grown into a cross-category brand spanning apparel, accessories, home goods, and more. Today, tens of millions of people across a growing number of countries come – and return – to Quince because they trust us to deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR CULTURE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a culture built for builders by builders. Our way of working starts with a blank sheet of paper. We question conventional thinking, use technology and data to uncover new opportunities, and move quickly to turn ideas into reality. We aren’t interested in replicating how others do retail. We’re building a better way – at a speed and scale unlike anything that’s been done before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We dream big and chase the hard problems others shy away from. Rejecting long-held assumptions is part of our company&#39;s DNA.&amp;nbsp; Where conventional wisdom says you have to choose – soft or durable, speed or rigor, quality or price – we ask why that trade-off has to exist in the first place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our pace is fast and the bar is high because our customers expect a lot from us and we refuse to let them down. We believe the best results come from challenging ourselves, learning from one another, and building on each other&#39;s strengths.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Here, responsibility is not determined by role, tenure, or seniority. Every team member - no matter their level - has the opportunity to drive our business and shape our trajectory.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re someone who likes to imagine new possibilities and build better systems rather than plug-in to outdated ones, Quince is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;THE ROLE&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, CRM Lifecycle + Journeys&lt;/strong&gt; owns every triggered flow in the customer journey across email, SMS, push, and in-app for UK, Germany, and France. You will build the automation engine that runs Quince&#39;s retention programme: from the welcome series a UK customer sees the day we launch, to the win-back flow that recovers a French customer six months later.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a builder role. You will spend most of your first six months in Iterable and the CDP. You will write the flow logic, set up the data pipes, design the experiments, and ship the AI agents that take work out of building, testing, and reporting on flows. The Director, CRM owns the retention strategy and the campaign calendar. You own the triggered flow programme that runs alongside it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Two constraints shape this job. UK and EU privacy rules mean the US lifecycle playbook does not transfer unchanged: you will rebuild the identity-resolution layer and shift weight toward logged-in and app behaviour. Channel economics also differ across markets, with SMS in particular materially more expensive in Europe than in the US, so the sequencing of email, SMS, push, and in-app per flow per market is not the same as the US default.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be joining a team that values speed, candor, and rigour. This role is for you if you like building things, you can hold a roadmap in one hand and a SQL query in the other, and you have an opinion on how AI changes lifecycle work over the next 18 months.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2663&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e0c03b8d-8a8f-42ae-b3e9-26b5a2308ae6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, launch, and own every triggered lifecycle flow for UK (July 2026), DE (October 2026), and FR (November 2026): welcome, browse abandon, cart abandon, post-purchase, low stock, back in stock, win-back, replenishment, care instructions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with MarTech to Ship AI agents and tooling that take work out of flow build, copy, segmentation, and QA. Target at least one end-to-end CRM agent in production by EoY1 and a 50% reduction in flow concept-to-deployment time within 90 days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Data team to run the triggered-flow testing roadmap with statistically sound design. Minimum 6 A/B tests per quarter per flow per market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build channel-cost decision logic across email, SMS, push, and in-app per flow per market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recover signal lost from fingerprinting and consent restrictions in UK/EU by pushing app and logged-in routing for non-consenting users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stand up and run the localisation pipeline with freelance copywriters for EN-UK, DE, and FR. Localised flow content live before each market launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with tech team to maintain CDP quality across UK/EU: data model, integrations (Iterable, Attentive, app SDK, site events), data hygiene, latency, and identity-resolution accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2753&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9ae6a13b-2175-4a37-a4c2-5839b2f592ae&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2769&quot; data-local-id=&quot;46937c2f-d543-4fbd-b76c-3593c6541fb4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Required: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years lifecycle/CRM marketing in DTC or ecommerce, including at least 3 years owning automated/triggered flows end to end (not campaign/blast).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on with Iterable (preferred), or comparable ESP (Braze, Klaviyo, SFMC). Must have built flows in the tool, not just briefed them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on with a CDP: Segment, mParticle, Hightouch, Census, or similar. Must understand identity resolution and data hygiene.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has built or deployed AI agents or LLM workflows in a marketing context (copy, segmentation, flow logic, QA). If you have not shipped one yet, you can describe the one you would ship in your first 90 days here.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL proficient. Can self-serve in Looker, Lookr, or BigQuery without waiting for an analyst.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A/B testing rigour. Knows what statistical significance means and where it breaks in lifecycle (sample size, primary metric selection, novelty effects).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of UK/EU privacy law (GDPR, PECR) and consent management. Understands what changes operationally when fingerprinting is restricted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented. Triggered flows live or die on edge cases (locale, currency, time zone, opt-in state, suppression rules).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional operator. Will work daily with creative, brand, data science, tech, and US CRM counterparts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3083&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dbaae2d5-3e8d-43bb-be8c-e1c7e3b63382&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Preferred:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;20322c78-4bdc-4d7a-af35-387a22f0e7ab&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Multi-market lifecycle experience (UK + DE or FR), fashion or home goods background, app-native lifecycle experience, fluency in DE or FR.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3150&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;All posted ranges are reflective of base salary and may vary depending upon experience level and location. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Bonus and equity may also be provided for eligible roles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£80,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£90,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3319&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;WHY QUINCE?&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3352&quot;&gt;Joining Quince means being part of a mission-driven team reshaping retail. You will work alongside talented colleagues, tackle meaningful challenges, and contribute to building a more sustainable, accessible future for customers and partners alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3604&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY &amp;amp; HIRING INTEGRITY&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3662&quot;&gt;Quince provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applications for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran or military status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4074&quot;&gt;Quince is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to qualified individuals with disabilities. If you need a reasonable accommodation to complete your application or to perform the essential functions of a role at Quince, please let us know by completing &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DpJ11jHa1WbqfUWB9&quot;&gt;this accommodation form&lt;/a&gt;. We review all requests individually and will work with you to determine appropriate accommodations on a case-by-case basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4428&quot;&gt;Employment is contingent upon successful completion of a background check. Quince will conduct background checks in compliance with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4604&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Security Advisory: Beware of Frauds&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4641&quot;&gt;At Quince, we&#39;re dedicated to recruiting top talent who share our drive for innovation. To safeguard candidates, Quince emphasizes legitimate recruitment practices. Initial communication is primarily via official Quince email addresses and LinkedIn; beware of deviations. Personal data and sensitive information will not be solicited during the application phase. Interviews are conducted via phone, in person, or through the approved platforms Google Meets or Zoom—never via messaging apps or other calling services. Offers are merit-based, communicated verbally, and followed up in writing. If personal information is requested to initiate the hiring process, rest assured it will be through secure and protected means.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5364&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Superchat, we&#39;re rebuilding how businesses talk to their customers. The phone call, the contact form, the support ticket: all of it is being replaced by messaging and AI. We&#39;re building the platform that runs underneath.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2020, Superchat has become the platform of choice for &lt;strong&gt;10,000+ businesses worldwide&lt;/strong&gt;, from globally recognized brands like Allianz, Auto1, Enpal, Danone, and GASAG to the small businesses, dental practices, and one-person startups that need to look bigger than they are. Today, &lt;strong&gt;millions of messages flow through Superchat every single day&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We started as a unified inbox: one place for every channel a customer might pick, WhatsApp, email, SMS, Instagram. Then ChatGPT happened, and the second chapter began: AI agents that respond across chat, email, and voice at the quality of the best human teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re &lt;strong&gt;100 people&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;profitable&lt;/strong&gt;, and have raised &lt;strong&gt;€18M in funding&lt;/strong&gt; (last round 4.5 years ago, we&#39;ve been growing on our own money since). Headquartered in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As our founding Account Executive for the Dutch market, you&#39;ll be the first commercial hire dedicated to the Netherlands. You&#39;ll own the full sales cycle end to end, from qualifying inbound demand through to close, while helping shape how we sell in the Dutch market as you go. Processes aren&#39;t fully built yet, and you&#39;ll be part of building them up.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Want&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;communicator&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;You&#39;re a native Dutch speaker with excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-confident.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You believe in your ability to run and close a conversation without coming across as arrogant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;re energized, not unsettled, by the fact that not everything is defined yet. You&#39;d rather help build the process than be handed one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coachable.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You take direct feedback without getting defensive, and visibly apply it in your next conversation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resilient.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You bounce back quickly from a lost deal or a tough week and keep your activity levels consistently high.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fast learner.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You get up to speed on a technical product quickly and can explain it to customers in a way they understand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;You keep your pipeline clean and your CRM notes reliable, without anyone having to chase you&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Who We Don&#39;t Want&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gets defensive with feedback.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You take direct feedback personally instead of applying it, and repeat the same mistakes call after call.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weak written communication.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You struggle to express yourself clearly and professionally in writing, whether that&#39;s emails, CRM notes, or follow-ups.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In it for the paycheck alone.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;re chasing the salary with no genuine interest in the craft of selling, and it shows in how little curiosity you bring to the work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Uncomfortable being first.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;d rather join an established team than be the one setting the tone for how the Dutch market gets sold.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Day To Day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demos &amp;amp; Product Presentation (~80%)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You convince prospects to join a product demo and book the relevant appointments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You present Superchat&#39;s capabilities convincingly and show customers how the product solves their specific challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act as the voice of the Dutch market in every customer conversation, since there&#39;s no established playbook yet to fall back on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Closing (~20%)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You convince prospects to sign a contract and successfully guide the sales cycle through to close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You flag patterns in objections or lost deals so the sales process keeps improving as we learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customers&lt;/strong&gt;: your most important point of contact day-to-day - from first outreach through demos to close&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for joint training, knowledge-sharing, and exchanging best practices across the sales cycle&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Success Team&lt;/strong&gt;: for handover after a successful close and a smooth start to onboarding&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why People Choose Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We believe in the power of in-person collaboration: We&#39;re an in-office culture at heart - we genuinely love being together in the Berlin office. That&#39;s where the best ideas happen, decisions move faster, and we learn from and grow with each other every day. We do offer some flexibility for remote work, but our default and our energy is being in the room together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We&#39;re an international team with diverse cultural backgrounds and languages. Openness, mutual respect, and the exchange of different perspectives shape the way we work together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value ambition and drive. We&#39;re looking for people who take ownership, show initiative, and are excited to grow quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We work with a high degree of ownership and a strong learning mindset. Asking questions, staying curious, and continuously improving are part of our everyday culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We care deeply about humility and teamwork. No egos, open feedback, and a willingness to learn from one another matter more to us than titles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Choose between an Urban Sports Club or John Reed membership, or a public transport pass/Dance subscription.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company-wide and team events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual €500 learning and development budget that you can use for conferences, courses, books, career coaching, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive and exciting startup culture that supports rapid professional and personal growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A beautiful office in the heart of Berlin (Prenzlauer Allee 242) with free snacks, drinks, and top-notch equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want to build a community, not just a company.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Creating an environment where people genuinely enjoy spending time together is important to us - whether that&#39;s through HYROX training, golf, beer pong tournaments, running clubs, Warhammer, weekend activities, or any other community you&#39;d like to build here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe that diversity makes companies stronger. We welcome applications from everyone, regardless of gender, background, nationality, or religion. Feel free to apply - we&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our Privacy Policy.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We look forward to receiving your application! 🙂&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.imgur.com/Uicf3C7.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Über uns: Wer/Was ist Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact ist eine weltweit führende Beratung für Daten- und KI-Dienstleistungen mit Hauptsitz in Paris. Mit mehr als 2.000 Consultants, Data Scientists und Engineers in 26 Ländern arbeiten wir mit den globalen Marktführern zusammen. An unseren deutschen Standorten befinden wir uns auf einem rasanten Wachstumskurs. Wir beraten führende nationale und internationale Kunden branchenübergreifend dabei, das volle Potenzial ihrer Daten auszuschöpfen, skalierbare Datenarchitekturen aufzubauen und innovative KI-Lösungen zu implementieren.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Senior Consultant (m/w/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; stehst du im Mittelpunkt dieser Mission. Du lieferst nicht nur statische Präsentationen, sondern schlägst die Brücke zwischen technologischen Möglichkeiten und geschäftlichen Anforderungen. Dabei begleitest du unsere Kunden von fokussierten Kurzzeit-Projekten im gehobenen Mittelstand bis hin zu mehrphasigen KI-Transformationen in Großkonzernen. In dieser Rolle übernimmst du die Verantwortung für crossfunktionale Workstreams, treibst datenbasierte Entscheidungen voran und gestaltest die digitale Zukunft unserer Kunden aktiv mit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das erwartet dich bei uns:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kundenberatung &amp;amp; Strategie:&lt;/strong&gt; Du arbeitest eng mit (internationalen) Kunden zusammen, verstehst deren geschäftliche Anforderungen und übersetzt diese in datengestützte Empfehlungen, die strategische Entscheidungen und die Business Transformation unterstützen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daten &amp;amp; Analyse:&lt;/strong&gt; Du sammelst, strukturierst und bereitest Daten für Analysen auf. Mit Tools wie Excel, SQL und Python identifizierst du Trends, Muster und konkrete Handlungsempfehlungen und kommunizierst diese klar an technische sowie nicht-technische Stakeholder.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Projektumsetzung:&lt;/strong&gt; Du übernimmst die Verantwortung für Projekt-Workstreams und stellst eine qualitativ hochwertige, termingerechte Lieferung im Einklang mit den übergeordneten Projektzielen sicher. Dabei arbeitest du kollaborativ in interdisziplinären Teams aus den Bereichen Consulting, Data und Tech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daten- &amp;amp; KI-Lösungen:&lt;/strong&gt; Du unterstützt die Entwicklung von Datenstrategien, KI-Use-Cases sowie Business-Intelligence-Lösungen und wirkst bei Governance-Frameworks und Implementierungs-Roadmaps mit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wissenstransfer &amp;amp; Kollaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Du trägst zu einer starken Teamkultur bei, indem du dein Wissen teilst, dich über digitale Trends und KI-Entwicklungen auf dem Laufenden hältst und die kontinuierliche Weiterentwicklung des Teams unterstützt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bringst du mit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Im Kern definieren wir uns über eine Kultur der Eigenverantwortung, der intellektuellen Neugier und der Zusammenarbeit. Wir suchen motivierte, fähige und umsichtige Talente, die hungrig auf neue Herausforderungen sind und die Chance nutzen wollen, zu lernen und zu wachsen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Berufserfahrung:&lt;/strong&gt; Du verfügst über mindestens 2-3 Jahre Erfahrung in der Management-/Datenberatung oder in einer entsprechenden Inhouse-Funktion. Zudem bringst du nachweisbare Erfolge in den Bereichen Daten-/KI-Strategie, Cloud-Transformation oder angewandte KI-/Machine-Learning-Projekte mit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daten- &amp;amp; KI-Verständnis:&lt;/strong&gt; Du besitzt eine hohe Affinität für Datenmanagement und moderne KI-Technologien. Konzepte wie Generative KI, LLMs oder Predictive Analytics sind dir vertraut und du brennst darauf, die Lücke zwischen Business-Anforderungen und KI-Einsatz zu schließen. Idealerweise hast du bereits Erfahrung in der Konzeption von KI-Use-Cases oder im Data-Platform-Tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business-Orientierung &amp;amp; analytisches Denken:&lt;/strong&gt; Du verbindest ausgeprägte analytische Fähigkeiten mit einer geschäftsorientierten Denkweise. Es macht dir Spaß, geschäftliche Herausforderungen zu identifizieren und sie in praktische, KI- und datengestützte Lösungen zu übersetzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technische Fähigkeiten:&lt;/strong&gt; Du bist sicher im Umgang mit Excel und PowerPoint. Praktische Erfahrung mit Statistik-Tools, BI-Software oder Programmiersprachen wie SQL, R oder Python zur Datenexploration und -aufbereitung ist ein klares Plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kommunikation &amp;amp; Teamgeist:&lt;/strong&gt; Du kommunizierst komplexe technische Themen sowohl auf Deutsch als auch auf Englisch klar und verständlich. Du arbeitest gerne in interdisziplinären Teams und schätzt die Zusammenarbeit über verschiedene Ebenen und Funktionen hinweg (z. B. als Übersetzer der Anforderungen zwischen Business-Stakeholdern und Data Scientists).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Persönlichkeit:&lt;/strong&gt; Du agierst proaktiv, strukturiert sowie lösungsorientiert und zeichnest dich durch eine ausgeprägte Kunden- und Stakeholder-Orientierung aus. Du blühst in dynamischen Umfeldern auf und hast Freude daran, komplexe Probleme zu lösen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sprachkenntnisse:&lt;/strong&gt; Sehr gute Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse sind eine Grundvoraussetzung. Du wirst an Kunden-Workshops teilnehmen, Präsentationen vor hochrangigen Entscheidungsträgern halten und Dokumente in beiden Sprachen verfassen. Weitere Sprachkenntnisse sind von Vorteil.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arbeitserlaubnis:&lt;/strong&gt; Eine gültige Arbeitserlaubnis für Deutschland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warum ARTEFACT?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Einflussreiche Kundenprojekte:&lt;/strong&gt; Arbeite an anspruchsvollen Projekten mit führenden nationalen und internationalen Kunden in den Bereichen Daten, Digitalisierung und zukunftsweisende Datenstrategie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Karriere- und Entwicklungschancen:&lt;/strong&gt; Wir glauben an Leistung, nicht an Dienstalter. Dein Aufstieg wird durch deinen Impact bestimmt, nicht durch deine Betriebszugehörigkeit - mit klaren Aufstiegsmöglichkeiten und vielfältigen Karriereperspektiven.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attraktive Vergütung:&lt;/strong&gt; Ein starkes Vergütungspaket inklusive eines leistungsabhängigen Bonus, der halbjährlich ausgezahlt wird.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lernen &amp;amp; Weiterentwicklung:&lt;/strong&gt; Werde Teil eines Teams aus passionierten Data Consultants, die sich gegenseitig aktiv unterstützen. Du lernst durch vielfältige Projekte, enge Zusammenarbeit und den Austausch mit führenden Experten der Branche - internationale Einsätze eingeschlossen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibilität &amp;amp; Freizeit:&lt;/strong&gt; Unbegrenztes Homeoffice und flexible Arbeitszeiten, 28 Tage Jahresurlaub sowie zusätzliche freie Tage über die Feiertage (Weihnachten und Silvester frei) und an deinem Geburtstag.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diese Position ist für die Standorte Berlin oder München ausgeschrieben.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keine Sorge, wenn du nicht alle Kriterien erfüllst! Bei Artefact schätzen wir Motivation, pragmatische Problemlösungskompetenz und Potenzial über alles. Wenn du hungrig auf neue Herausforderungen bist und die KI-Revolution leidenschaftlich mitgestalten willst, freuen wir uns von dir zu hören.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vielfalt &amp;amp; Inklusion bei Artefact:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Wir sind überzeugt, dass einzigartige Perspektiven Innovationen vorantreiben. Bei Artefact setzen wir uns für ein inklusives Umfeld ein, in dem jeder sich entfalten kann. Wir begrüßen und berücksichtigen alle Bewerbungen rein auf Basis von Leistung, Fähigkeiten und Potenzial – unabhängig von geschlechtlicher Identität, sexueller Orientierung, Herkunft, Ethnizität, Religion, Alter, Hintergrund oder Behinderung. Komm so, wie du bist!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bereit für den nächsten Schritt? Bitte sende uns deinen Lebenslauf, der deine Erfahrung und deine Leidenschaft für die Rolle als &lt;strong&gt;Senior Consultant (m/w/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; zeigt. Wir freuen uns auf deine Bewerbung!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bei Fragen kannst du uns gerne eine Nachricht an ----- senden.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who/What is Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact. With 2,000+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 26 countries, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. At our German offices, we are on a rapid growth trajectory, advising leading national and international clients cross-industry on how to unlock the full potential of their data, build scalable data architectures, and implement cutting-edge AI solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Consultant (m/f/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;, you will sit at the center of this mission. You won&#39;t just deliver static slides; you will bridge the gap between technical possibilities and business imperatives, guiding clients from a focused short-term engagement with &lt;em&gt;Mittelstand&lt;/em&gt; manufacturers to multi-phase AI transformations with enterprises. In this role, you will take ownership of cross-functional workstreams, drive data-driven decision-making, and actively shape the digital future of our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client advisory &amp;amp; strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with (international) clients to understand their business needs and translate them into data-driven recommendations that support strategic decision-making and business transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Collect, synthesise and iterate data to create actionable insights. You work with a modern, AI-native toolstack - from LLM-powered environments (e.g. Claude, Gemini, ChatGPT) and agentic workflow tools (e.g. n8n, Lovable) to coding assistants and automation platforms - and communicate findings clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders. Familiarity with SQL or Python remains a plus, but the ability to leverage AI tools to accelerate analysis and delivery is what we value most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Take ownership of project workstreams and ensure high-quality, timely delivery in alignment with overall project goals. Work collaboratively within interdisciplinary teams across consulting, data, and tech functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; AI solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the development of data strategies, AI use cases, and business intelligence solutions, contributing to governance frameworks and implementation roadmaps where relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge sharing &amp;amp; collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to a strong team culture by sharing knowledge, staying up to date with digital and AI trends, and supporting continuous team development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business development &amp;amp; thought leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively contribute to Artefact’s growth in Germany - supporting client proposals, shaping new service offerings, and creating intellectual capital such as frameworks, point-of-views, and benchmarks that strengthen our market position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At our heart, we define ourselves by a culture of ownership, intellectual curiosity, and cooperation. &lt;strong&gt;We are looking for driven, capable talents who bring strong motivation and curiosity for new challenges.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You have at least 2–3 years of experience in management consulting, technology consulting, or in-house corporate strategy roles, with a proven track record of participating in data/AI strategy, cloud transformation, or applied AI/Machine Learning projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; A completed university degree (Bachelor’s or Master&#39;s) in Business Administration, Economics, Computer Science, Business Informatics, Physics, Mathematics, or a comparable quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; You possess a strong affinity for data management and modern AI technologies. You are familiar with concepts like Generative AI, LLMs, or predictive analytics and are eager to bridge the gap between business needs and AI deployment. Ideally, you have hands-on experience in AI use case conceptualization or data platform tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business &amp;amp; analytical mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You combine strong analytical skills with a business-oriented perspective. You enjoy identifying business problems and translating them into practical AI and data-driven solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical skills:&lt;/strong&gt; You are confident working with PowerPoint and Google Slides to produce polished client-ready output. More importantly, you know how to leverage AI tools - from LLM environments to agentic workflows - to run analysis, generate insights, and accelerate delivery. Experience with SQL, BI tools, or programming languages is not a requirement, but comfort with structured data and a hands-on attitude toward new tools is expected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; You communicate complex technical topics clearly in both German and English. You enjoy working in interdisciplinary teams and collaborating across different levels and functions (e.g., translating requirements between business stakeholders and data scientists).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal attributes:&lt;/strong&gt; You are proactive, structured, and solution-oriented, with a strong client focus and stakeholder understanding. You thrive in dynamic environments and enjoy solving complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Business-fluent German and English are required - you will participate in client workshops, present to senior stakeholders, and write deliverables in both languages. Additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; A valid work permit for Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why ARTEFACT?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impactful client work:&lt;/strong&gt; Work on challenging projects with leading national and international clients across data, digitalisation, and advanced data strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career growth opportunities:&lt;/strong&gt; We believe in performance over tenure. Your growth is driven by your impact, not your length of service, with clear opportunities to progress and diverse career prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive rewards:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong compensation package including a performance-based bonus, which is paid out half-yearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; development:&lt;/strong&gt; Join a team of passionate Data Consultants who actively support each other. You&#39;ll learn through diverse projects, collaboration, and exposure to leading experts in the field - including international work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; time off: &lt;/strong&gt;Hybrid working model, 28 days of annual leave, plus your birthday as well as Christmas &amp;amp; New Year&#39;s Eve&amp;nbsp;off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is based in Berlin or Munich.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don&#39;t worry if you don&#39;t meet all the criteria!&lt;/strong&gt; At Artefact, we value motivation, pragmatic problem-solving, and potential above all else.If you are excited about shaping the future of AI and ready to make a real impact, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion at Artefact&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;gt; We believe that unique perspectives fuel innovation. At Artefact, we are committed to creating an inclusive environment where everyone can thrive. We welcome and consider all applications purely based on merit, skills, and potential - regardless of gender identity, sexual orientation, race, ethnicity, religion, age, background, or disability. Come as you are!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to take the next step?&lt;/strong&gt; Please submit your CV showcasing your experience and passion for this role as a Senior Consultant (m/f/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy. We look forward to receiving your application!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
